<para>Holds no state <mdash/> every method is <computeroutput>static</computeroutput> <mdash/> and implements the standard Lovasz / REDI / SWAPI primitives that the engine&apos;s LLL driver calls. Works over rings where the comparison threshold <computeroutput>alphaTop / alphaBottom</computeroutput> can be evaluated (typically <computeroutput><ref refid="ringelem_8hpp_a845589cbe81fb92f0ca26c8b911f8f38_1a845589cbe81fb92f0ca26c8b911f8f38" kindref="member">QQ</ref></computeroutput> or <computeroutput><ref refid="ringelem_8hpp_afea72c39052b53d15e7acad8d36847c1_1afea72c39052b53d15e7acad8d36847c1" kindref="member">ZZ</ref></computeroutput> with a rational alpha). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
